| Performing space | da-g2-stage (unit 12, days 179 to 192) | da-g3-stage (unit 4) | Separate zones and a staging extra become named stage areas and a first costume, music, scenery or light choice |

Each pick-up above is answered at both ends in data/progressions/arts.csv (the grade 3 rows' `assumes` cells).

