206: material and the voice; nothing is bought, and every unit lists a cheap stand-in. A tool day has a printed version
207: that does the same job. The teacher needs no training in the discipline: each unit's teacher page says what to look
208: and listen for, in plain words. One child at home is the second room: the parent is the audience and the critique
209: partner, a showing is to the family or a recorded take, and a duet or group piece has a solo or doubled version.
